ar names like React, Angular, and Vue.js to lesser-known options such as Ember.js and Meteor.js.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-javascript-frameworks\/#faq-question-1786174360686\",\"position\":3,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-javascript-frameworks\/#faq-question-1786174360686\",\"name\":\"Q3. Which are the best JavaScript frameworks for front-end development?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The best JavaScript frameworks for the front end include React, Angular, Vue.js, Svelte, and Next.js. Each helps build fast, interactive, and reusable user interfaces.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-javascript-frameworks\/#faq-question-1786174378742\",\"position\":4,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-javascript-frameworks\/#faq-question-1786174378742\",\"name\":\"Q4. Which are the best JavaScript frameworks for backend development?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"For the backend, Express.js, Nest.js, Meteor.js, Koa.js, and Sails.js are top choices. They handle APIs, server logic, and scalable real-time applications efficiently.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-javascript-frameworks\/#faq-question-1786174398447\",\"position\":5,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-javascript-frameworks\/#faq-question-1786174398447\",\"name\":\"Q5.\u00a0What JavaScript framework does Google use?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Google uses Angular, its own comprehensive framework for building dynamic web apps. Products like Google AdWords and the Google Cloud Console are built with it.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-javascript-frameworks\/#faq-question-1786174415081\",\"position\":6,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-javascript-frameworks\/#faq-question-1786174415081\",\"name\":\"Q6. When should you use a JavaScript framework?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Use one when your app is complex or needs scalability, reusability, and speed. Frameworks organize your code and handle common\u00a0tasks\u00a0so you build faster.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-javascript-frameworks\/#faq-question-1786174434097\",\"position\":7,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-javascript-frameworks\/#faq-question-1786174434097\",\"name\":\"Q7. Which JavaScript framework should I learn first?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Beginners often start with React or Vue.js for their gentle learning curves and large communities. Your final choice should match your project goals.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-javascript-frameworks\/#faq-question-1786174448040\",\"position\":8,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-javascript-frameworks\/#faq-question-1786174448040\",\"name\":\"Q8. Which JavaScript framework is most popular?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"React is currently the most popular JavaScript framework, backed by Meta and a huge community. Angular and Vue.js follow closely.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-javascript-frameworks\/#faq-question-1786174461681\",\"position\":9,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-javascript-frameworks\/#faq-question-1786174461681\",\"name\":\"Q9.